msgctxt "76"
msgid "Thanks so much! You don't know how much this means to us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "You're our hero!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Stop that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Now we can go back to the Dragon Palace... and that means we can reopen the "
"gambling hall! Hahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Hey, not so loud, ya idiot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "What gambling hall?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Keep it under your hat, but... us homeless guys like to get together and "
"run some games of chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "We have cee-lo, hanafuda... you know. Well, yeah. Of course you know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yeah! How about you join our little club? That's all right, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yeah, we owe you one. You come by and play any time you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "All right. I'll stop by some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"We'll be waitin' for ya! Now we gotta go tell our buddies the Dragon Palace "
"is ours again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

